    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94757" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκευωρ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>care of baggage</i>, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.15
			</span></i>: generally, <i>great care, excessive care</i>, 
