					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					631b15
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ περὶ ταῦτα ς</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>GA</u>
